{"title":"Project Coordinator Roadmap","role":"Project Coordinator","summary":"A Project Coordinator supports project managers and cross-functional teams by coordinating schedules, tasks, documentation, resources, meetings, risks, and project communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Industrial Engineering & Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Project Coordinator supports project managers and cross-functional teams by coordinating schedules, tasks, documentation, resources, meetings, risks, and project communication."},{"type":"p","text":"For an Industrial Engineering & Management graduate, this is a suitable pathway because the degree develops:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations management"},{"text":"Project planning"},{"text":"Process optimization"},{"text":"Production systems"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Resource management"},{"text":"Cost analysis"},{"text":"Operations research"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Quality management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role is broader than administrative coordination. In technical and industrial organizations, a strong Project Coordinator should understand project planning, dependencies, budgets, KPIs, risk management, engineering workflows, and stakeholder communication."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Area","Potential Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Project Coordination"},{"text":"Project Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Associate Project Manager"}],[{"text":"PMO"},{"text":"PMO Analyst / PMO Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Operations Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Engineering Projects"},{"text":"Engineering Project Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Manufacturing Project Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Construction"},{"text":"Project Planning Coordinator"}],[{"text":"IT Projects"},{"tex